"<div><section class=\"hero\"><div><p class=\"eyebrow\" id=\"edition\"></p><h1 id=\"headline\"></h1><p class=\"intro\">Team records, single-season player records, and club championships.<br>Search by statistic, player, category, or season.</p><a href=\"#explore\" class=\"hero-link\">Open the record book \u2193</a></div><figure class=\"records-hero-photo\"><img src=\"/images/records-hero.webp\" alt=\"Matt and Kaden celebrating together on the ice\" width=\"1200\" height=\"749\" fetchpriority=\"high\"><figcaption>BARDOWNSKI / THE RECORD BOOK</figcaption></figure></section><section class=\"spotlights\" aria-label=\"Featured records\"></section><div class=\"coverage\"><b>READ THE FINE PRINT</b><p>Historical records from 2023, 2024, and 2025\u20132026 (NHL 26). The internal 2025 key refers to the archived 2025\u20132026 season, not the new 2026\u20132027 campaign. Older tables are partial leaderboards. Plus/minus is absent in 2023 and 2024, so its record has limited historical coverage.</p><span>2023 / 2024 / 2025</span></div><section id=\"explore\" class=\"explorer\"><div class=\"section-heading\"><div><p class=\"eyebrow\">THE RECORD INDEX</p><h2 id=\"index-title\">Search All Records</h2></div><p>Filter by category, scope, or season.<br>Open a record for its holder, value, and criteria.</p></div><div class=\"workspace\"><aside class=\"categories\"><p class=\"eyebrow\">BROWSE BY CATEGORY</p><div id=\"categories\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Record category\"></div><div class=\"sidebar-note\"><b>Not just a number.</b><p>Open any record for the ranking, eligibility rule, source, and limits.</p></div></aside><div class=\"results-area\"><div class=\"controls\"><label class=\"search\">Search records<input id=\"search\" type=\"search\" placeholder=\"Try +/\u2212, Robby, blocks, goalie\u2026\" autocomplete=\"off\"></label><label>Scope<select id=\"scope\"><option value=\"all\">All scopes</option><option value=\"Season\">Unqualified rate records</option><option value=\"Single game\">Single game</option><option value=\"All-time\">Single-season / history</option></select></label><label>Season<select id=\"season\"><option value=\"all\">Compare all seasons</option><option value=\"2025\">2025\u20132026 (NHL 26 archive)</option><option value=\"2024\">2024</option><option value=\"2023\">2023</option></select></label><label>Availability<select id=\"availability\"><option value=\"all\">All records</option><option value=\"verified\">Available stats</option><option value=\"pending\">Needs more data</option></select></label></div><div class=\"quick\"><span>QUICK FINDS</span><button data-query=\"plus minus\">+/\u2212</button><button data-query=\"defense\">Defensemen</button><button data-query=\"save\">Goaltending</button><button data-query=\"per game\">Per game</button><button id=\"reset\">Reset filters \u21ba</button></div><div class=\"result-meta\"><p id=\"result-count\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></p><label>Sort<select id=\"sort\"><option value=\"featured\">Featured first</option><option value=\"az\">Record A\u2013Z</option><option value=\"category\">Category</option></select></label></div><div id=\"results\"></div></div></div></section><section class=\"roadmap\"><p class=\"eyebrow\">RECORD DATA & COVERAGE</p><h2>Sources and Eligibility</h2><div><article><b>01 / Single-season player records</b><p>Single-season peaks compared across the Stats tab\u2019s 2023, 2024, and 2025\u20132026 tables\u2014not sums of incomplete player histories.</p></article><article><b>02 / Game-level records</b><p>Plus/minus, points, assists, saves, and blocks in one game. Connect verified match history before calling a winner.</p></article><article><b>03 / Historical coverage</b><p>Historical leaders are now included. Missing metrics, missing eligibility inputs, and partial leaderboards are disclosed for each record.</p></article></div></section></div><dialog id=\"detail\"><button class=\"close\" aria-label=\"Close record details\">\u00d7</button><div id=\"detail-content\"></div></dialog>"
